    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Space Survival RPG</strong></h2>Pioneer your own planet with Space Frontier. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/4e8fc934ccdcdb7eba833a9a0498df50.poster.avif?t=1704704071\" width=600 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/4e8fc934ccdcdb7eba833a9a0498df50.webm?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/4e8fc934ccdcdb7eba833a9a0498df50.mp4?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft</strong></h2>Gather resources and craft items to survive and conquer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2>Build your base, establish a settlement, and design your own planet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/fe437a8fbf95ed2d3bb9d202826110b3.poster.avif?t=1704704071\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/fe437a8fbf95ed2d3bb9d202826110b3.webm?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/fe437a8fbf95ed2d3bb9d202826110b3.mp4?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2>Explore planet Arcadia. Battle alien creatures, harsh environments, and other hungry survivors. Vie for valuable resources to bring back to your planet.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure</strong></h2>Meet new NPCs as you explore. Recruit them to your crew. Complete quests for rare resources and rewards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/af2c2d845fd4625985f35a4a1bb854c3.poster.avif?t=1704704071\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/af2c2d845fd4625985f35a4a1bb854c3.webm?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/af2c2d845fd4625985f35a4a1bb854c3.mp4?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
