s=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/af2c2d845fd4625985f35a4a1bb854c3.poster.avif?t=1704704071\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/af2c2d845fd4625985f35a4a1bb854c3.webm?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669180/extras/af2c2d845fd4625985f35a4a1bb854c3.mp4?t=1704704071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
